    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1334">

                <pb facs="1308" n="1298" xml:id="pg1298"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">393.1115/8–1649: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Consul at Shanghai</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >McConaughy</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Shanghai</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-08-16T16:00:00+08:00">August 16, 1949—4
                            p. m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received August 16—6:09 a. m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>3257. Re Cantel 938, August 13 [<hi rendition="#italic">14</hi>,]<anchor n="22"
                        xml:id="d1334-f1"/> attitude Nationalist Government toward <hi
                        rendition="#italic">General Gordon</hi> entry Shanghai. Important we know at
                    earliest possible moment terms and conditions to be imposed on <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Gordon</hi> or other evacuation ship. Term “repatriation
                    vessel” used reftel needs close definition. If Nationalists have in mind giving
                    safe conduct only to specially chartered vessels which will come here empty and
                    take out only passengers proceeding directly to US more or less à la <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Gripsholm</hi> of 1942–43,<anchor n="22a"
                        xml:id="d1334-f2"/> our present unremitting efforts bring in <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Gordon</hi> and other ships on regular runs are probably
                    wasted.</p>
                <p>We are working in dark until we know nature contemplated Nationalist safe
                    conduct.</p>
                <p>Sent Department, repeated OffEmb Canton 1014, Nanking 1776.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">McConaughy</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
